  "description": "Apache Avro serialization plugin for the Excalibur framework. Schema-based binary serialization optimized for streaming and Kafka scenarios. Requires matching reader and writer schemas (no writer-schema resolution); writer/reader schema skew is detected via the Avro single-object-encoding fingerprint and fails closed (throws), never silently mis-decoded.",
